  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Neemo Finance is an Astar/Soneium-focused liquid staking and restaking protocol for ASTR and ETH. Users receive liquid derivative tokens such as nsASTR and nrETH while participating in staking/restaking strategies. Current public TVL attribution should be treated as Astar/Soneium-focused rather than Ethereum-mainnet-primary unless supported by matching chain TVL and deployed contracts.",
    "relationship_narrative": "The Neemo Finance family contains the core protocol logic, which is used by the Ethereum Mainnet and Soneium families through proxy contracts. The Ethereum Mainnet family includes a proxy pointing to an implementation shared with the Neemo Finance family, indicating shared infrastructure for liquid restaking across chains.",
